# spec_id: eravos.organism.tape-memory · version 1.0.0 · phase P135 · status built 2026-11-06 (his "yes" to the specs and the UI preview)
# the design (ports, params, signal_dag, decisions, open gaps): tools/music/planned/tape-memory.spec · the face: tools/music/planned/tape-memory.ui.md
identity:
  id: eravos.tape-memory ; label: Tape Memory ; icon: 📼 ; accent: "#d6b37a" (sun-faded cassette tan) ; category: Effects
  comp_intent: the tape itself on the whole sound — wow, flutter, hiss, crackle, dropouts, copies of copies, the machine's character, tape stop
  engine_notes: |
    Seven components wired as the design's signal_dag says (saturator-tape, bitcrusher, delay-line ×2 (L/R), filter-svf ×3, osc-noise ×2,
    random-source ×5, tape-transport), each its own tested worklet; every timed value an AudioParam (live and offline alike). The tape
    sits 15 ms behind; the effect shell delays the blended dry to match. Settings given before the sound starts land at once; while it
    plays they glide over 20 ms (no clicks). The saturator's output is trimmed as the drive comes in (−4.5 dB − the machine's bump at full),
    so a hot input stays under full scale; clean (drive 0) is untrimmed and level.
config: mode [cassette, vhs, reel, dictaphone] · wear · generation 1–8 · wow · flutter · speed 0.5–1.5 · hiss · crackle · dropouts · lowCut ·
  highCut · drive · wowRate · flutterRate · stereoWow · wowSync [free, 1 bar, 2 bars, 1/2] · crackleSize · dropLen · hissTone · head · bits ·
  rate · stopTime · stopped · + the effect shell's mix, inGain, outGain, bypass (outGain is the face's Out — the design's "level")
ports:
  in: fx.hook.audio_in · tm.hook.transport_in (Wow on the beat) · tm.hook.mod_wear · tm.hook.mod_speed · fx.hook.mod_mix · knob.<every other control>
  out: fx.hook.audio_out · tm.hook.dropout (0/1 while a dropout happens)
packs: factory — Lofi Cassette · Third Generation Dub · Mall Ghost · Tracking Error · Pocket Recorder · Sunbleached Reel · Chewed Tape ·
  lofi — Lofi Study · Lofi Rainy · Lofi Late Night (the Lofi setup's scenes)
proof (2026-11-06): tape-memory.test.js 8/8 — the tool contract (4); clean = the sound 15 ms late, pitch and level kept; Wow moves the pitch,
  Speed 0.8 plays 352 Hz, silence stays silence with no dust, Hiss and Crackle add their own; Tape stop stops the tone, dropouts dip the
  sound and have a port; every preset under full scale, finite. Design check D1–D6 all 0. Components: their own tests (node tests/components.mjs).
open (none hidden): packs — one preset per planned pack name (the design's ≥ 6 per pack not met) · COPIES re-applies the wear as numbers, not a
  chain of real copies (decided) · Open as components (each part its own window) not built yet · cpu not yet measured (build/perf.mjs)

